# #5837, the claimless advance: the split transfer and the receiver's close heads.
MODULE: ReadPositionHonestTransferWithoutGeneration
TARGET: ReadPositionHonest
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: T1: a stale duplicate receiver, passing its in-memory span check, appends a transfer of keys it no longer owns with no routing generation: admitted after the re-claim and in no staleHigh
PERTURBS: StaleRouteAlloc
BOUNDS: WithFreeAdvance = TRUE, WithKeyMove = TRUE, MaxWindows = 0, WithMixedVersion = FALSE

--- FIND
    /\ next < MaxOff
    /\ 1 >= gL
    /\ dUsed' = TRUE
--- REPLACE
    /\ next < MaxOff
\* MUTATION: no generation, so never refused.
    /\ dUsed' = TRUE
--- END

--- FIND
    /\ sHi' = IF FreeOn THEN next ELSE sHi
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: and in no generation's staleHigh.
    /\ UNCHANGED sHi
--- END
